WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:04.000
<b>This is our maid,</b>

00:04.460 --> 00:06.080
<b>Mrs. Mitsuyama.</b>

00:06.290 --> 00:09.000
<b>Just call me Micchan.</b>

00:09.090 --> 00:12.760
<b>He's as cute as a canary,
just like you said!</b>

00:12.840 --> 00:15.220
<b>Let's have a lot of good talks, okay?</b>

00:15.300 --> 00:18.260
<b>Such gorgeous hair!
What do you call that color?</b>

00:18.350 --> 00:19.310
<b>Uh…</b>

00:19.390 --> 00:21.810
<b>What's your favorite dish your mom makes?</b>

00:21.890 --> 00:22.600
<b>Uhh…</b>

00:22.730 --> 00:25.480
<b>You're starting school tomorrow, right?</b>

00:27.980 --> 00:28.940
<b>Yes…</b>

00:29.070 --> 00:32.440
<b>That's enough for now, Micchan.</b>

00:32.530 --> 00:33.740
<b>For the past 20 years</b>

00:33.820 --> 00:37.240
<b>Micchan has been coming
to help around the house.</b>

00:37.320 --> 00:39.410
<b>'Cause Yocchan here is a little lazy!</b>

00:40.200 --> 00:42.000
<b>Shut up, Micchan!</b>

00:42.540 --> 00:43.620
<b>Mrs. Mitsuyama.</b>

00:43.710 --> 00:46.000
<b>Is our house the only one you help clean?</b>

00:46.080 --> 00:47.380
<b>No.</b>

00:47.460 --> 00:50.420
<b>I've been in
a lot of homes in Origon Village.</b>

00:52.800 --> 00:54.340
<b>Mrs. Mitsuyama,</b>

00:54.420 --> 00:57.800
<b>can you tell me about
the other homes in the village?</b>

00:57.890 --> 00:59.600
<b>No can do, honey.</b>

00:59.680 --> 01:00.140
<b>Huh?</b>

01:00.810 --> 01:04.310
<b>I can't talk about the other homes.</b>

01:05.100 --> 01:07.860
<b><i>You were</i>
<i>running your mouth just a second ago.</i></b>

01:08.480 --> 01:09.570
<b>Of course not.</b>

01:09.650 --> 01:13.110
<b>Imagine if she told others
what your underpants look like.</b>

01:13.190 --> 01:15.110
<b>Oh, Dear.</b>

01:15.200 --> 01:18.870
<b>That wouldn't
be embarrassing at all, you know!</b>

01:18.950 --> 01:19.950
<b>I mean,</b>

01:20.030 --> 01:23.410
<b>they're such cute little
striped underpants!</b>

01:23.500 --> 01:24.790
<b>Mom!</b>

01:25.080 --> 01:28.790
<b>Oh, are your underpants striped?</b>

01:28.880 --> 01:31.340
<b>That's adorable.</b>

01:33.590 --> 01:35.050
<b>Oh? Hitori?</b>

03:08.850 --> 03:10.020
<b>It's not like</b>

03:10.100 --> 03:12.600
<b>I want to wear these!</b>

03:13.650 --> 03:16.690
<b>We are pretending to be one
so we can search everywhere</b>

03:16.780 --> 03:18.780
<b>for our mother's murderer!</b>

03:18.860 --> 03:20.990
<b>And that's why we have no choice</b>

03:21.070 --> 03:23.240
<b>but to wear stripey underpants!</b>

03:23.320 --> 03:24.780
<b>The audacity!</b>

03:25.660 --> 03:29.750
<b>"There's nothing embarrassing
about that whatsoever!"</b>

03:31.540 --> 03:33.170
<b>What are you laughing at?</b>

03:33.830 --> 03:35.250
<b>Do that again.</b>

03:36.960 --> 03:37.710
<b>Eh?</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:41.380
<b>Shut up, Micchan!</b>

03:43.430 --> 03:47.350
<b>They're such
cute little striped underpants!</b>

03:49.890 --> 03:53.600
<b>We might be able to
make use of that skill, Migi.</b>

03:55.360 --> 03:58.480
<b>It's exhausting, really!</b>

03:58.570 --> 04:00.190
<b>The Yamazakis,</b>

04:00.280 --> 04:02.950
<b>They kept saying my food was bland.</b>

04:03.030 --> 04:05.700
<b>They wouldn't notice it
even if it were poisoned!</b>

04:05.780 --> 04:09.040
<b>Oh, you, Micchan!</b>

04:24.840 --> 04:26.390
<b>You really are the only one</b>

04:26.470 --> 04:29.060
<b>I can talk to about these things.</b>

04:29.140 --> 04:33.190
<b>Can I tell you about something too?</b>

04:33.270 --> 04:35.650
<b>What is it?</b>

04:35.730 --> 04:37.310
<b>I was thinking that maybe</b>

04:37.400 --> 04:39.150
<b>I want to change the wallpaper.</b>

04:39.230 --> 04:40.780
<b>Oh, how nice.</b>

04:40.860 --> 04:42.820
<b>What do you want instead?</b>

04:44.110 --> 04:45.320
<b>This pattern.</b>

04:45.410 --> 04:47.490
<b>Oh, paisley?</b>

04:47.570 --> 04:49.280
<b>That's very elegant.</b>

04:49.370 --> 04:51.540
<b>But you know,</b>

04:51.620 --> 04:53.750
<b>I'm still not sure of it.</b>

04:53.830 --> 04:55.420
<b>Why not?</b>

04:55.870 --> 04:57.460
<b>What if</b>

04:58.540 --> 05:00.710
<b>somewhere in the village</b>

05:00.800 --> 05:03.420
<b>someone else has a wallpaper like this?</b>

05:05.380 --> 05:08.470
<b>A paisley patterned wallpaper?</b>

05:09.560 --> 05:10.140
<b>Oh!</b>

05:10.220 --> 05:13.140
<b>One of the rooms at the Ichijos' place!</b>

05:13.230 --> 05:14.810
<b>The Ichijos…</b>

05:20.570 --> 05:21.900
<b>Yes.</b>

05:22.990 --> 05:26.610
<b>Thank you for telling me.</b>

05:28.030 --> 05:30.780
<b><i>So far so good. That went well.</i></b>

05:31.950 --> 05:33.700
<b><i>What a relief.</i></b>

05:34.830 --> 05:38.710
<b><i>We really</i>
<i>used that old lady to our advantage.</i></b>

05:39.290 --> 05:41.130
<b>But Yocchan,</b>

05:41.210 --> 05:44.300
<b>it is amazing that you have Hitori now.</b>

05:45.260 --> 05:47.930
<b>I remember one time you said,</b>

05:48.010 --> 05:51.260
<b>that laundry tells you
a lot about your love for someone.</b>

05:51.640 --> 05:53.520
<b><i>I know about it, you see.</i></b>

05:53.600 --> 05:55.230
<b><i>That a lazybones like you</i></b>

05:55.310 --> 05:58.690
<b><i>is happily handwashing her child's clothes.</i></b>

05:59.230 --> 06:03.530
<b>You really treasure him, don't you?</b>

06:18.210 --> 06:19.500
<b>Mother…</b>

06:42.400 --> 06:45.150
<b>The Ichijos' son goes to school.</b>

06:45.690 --> 06:48.610
<b>We'll begin approaching him tomorrow.</b>

06:49.030 --> 06:49.910
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:50.110 --> 06:52.660
<b>We'll search every corner of their house.</b>

07:07.710 --> 07:09.170
<b>Fully matching</b>

07:09.260 --> 07:10.550
<b>as we walk in synch.</b>

07:11.010 --> 07:12.390
<b>Time to go.</b>

07:12.680 --> 07:14.260
<b>To the house of learning.</b>

07:16.310 --> 07:19.180
<b>ORIGON VILLAGE</b>

07:27.900 --> 07:30.450
<b>-Uhm…
-Oh, it's right there!</b>

07:30.530 --> 07:32.200
<b>-There it is!
-I'm in 1-5.</b>

07:32.280 --> 07:34.580
<b>They're announcing the classes.</b>

07:34.660 --> 07:36.660
<b>I wonder which one I'm in.</b>

07:36.740 --> 07:40.540
<b>Let's see, you are…</b>

07:40.620 --> 07:43.130
<b>I found your name, right there!</b>

07:43.210 --> 07:44.790
<b>You are in 1-5!</b>

07:45.380 --> 07:47.050
<b>Hitori!</b>

07:47.130 --> 07:48.880
<b>Can you believe it?</b>

07:48.960 --> 07:50.550
<b>We're in the same class.</b>

07:50.970 --> 07:54.140
<b>Oh! I know you, you're…</b>

07:54.220 --> 07:55.100
<b>Akiyama.</b>

07:55.180 --> 07:57.720
<b>-I am Hitori's best friend!
<i>-Where is Eiji?</i></b>

07:57.810 --> 07:59.850
<b>-Oh, I never knew!
<i>-He's not there?</i></b>

08:00.020 --> 08:01.480
<b>You should come over soon.</b>

08:01.560 --> 08:02.640
<b>How's thrice a week?</b>

08:02.730 --> 08:03.600
<b><i>It's not there.</i></b>

08:06.150 --> 08:07.270
<b><i>Where is it?</i></b>

08:09.860 --> 08:10.940
<b><i>Eiji…</i></b>

08:15.120 --> 08:17.990
<b>Eiji is in 1-1.</b>

08:18.450 --> 08:20.330
<b>Yes, he is.</b>

08:20.410 --> 08:23.040
<b>Eiji is in the advanced class, you see.</b>

08:23.120 --> 08:23.960
<b>Advanced?</b>

08:24.040 --> 08:25.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:25.960 --> 08:28.000
<b>Suppose you could say</b>

08:28.090 --> 08:30.090
<b>it's a class for gifted kids.</b>

08:30.170 --> 08:31.340
<b>Even though</b>

08:31.420 --> 08:34.010
<b>you're a gift in yourself, Hitori.</b>

08:34.180 --> 08:36.800
<b>I guess the classes aren't that different.</b>

08:39.680 --> 08:41.850
<b>Freshmen representative,</b>

08:41.930 --> 08:42.810
<b>greet everyone.</b>

08:42.890 --> 08:45.690
<b>As we are welcomed by
the rays of the spring sun,</b>

08:45.770 --> 08:47.730
<b>and the swelling cherry blossoms,</b>

08:47.810 --> 08:49.070
<b>on this wonderful day,</b>

08:49.150 --> 08:52.530
<b>we carried out our entrance ceremony.</b>

08:55.360 --> 08:56.490
<b>I finally made it.</b>

08:57.070 --> 08:58.780
<b>I have to find Dali.</b>

08:58.870 --> 09:02.000
<b>Starting today,
we are junior high school students.</b>

09:02.450 --> 09:04.040
<b>And on this day…</b>

09:04.120 --> 09:05.370
<b><i>There's no…</i></b>

09:05.460 --> 09:07.630
<b>The worries and joys of junior high…</b>

09:07.710 --> 09:10.630
<b><i>difference?</i></b>

09:10.710 --> 09:14.090
<b><i>It's night and day!</i></b>

09:14.170 --> 09:16.590
<b>And we are confused…</b>

09:17.800 --> 09:18.600
<b>Is it true</b>

09:18.680 --> 09:21.220
<b>that you're from an orphanage?</b>

09:21.310 --> 09:23.930
<b>Watching over us…</b>

09:24.060 --> 09:27.560
<b>So we put our faith in you.</b>

09:27.650 --> 09:29.400
<b><i>Maruta…</i></b>

09:35.400 --> 09:36.700
<b>Hitori!</b>

09:37.200 --> 09:38.870
<b>You should stay away from me.</b>

09:39.490 --> 09:41.080
<b>Or they'll bully you too.</b>

09:43.620 --> 09:44.500
<b>Well…</b>

09:46.420 --> 09:49.710
<b>The internal students already know, but…</b>

09:49.790 --> 09:52.800
<b>Getting high scores on exams?</b>

09:52.880 --> 09:56.050
<b>Apparently that's how
one joins a better class,</b>

09:56.550 --> 09:58.260
<b>and how we get closer to Eiji.</b>

09:58.340 --> 10:01.220
<b>B-b-but…</b>

10:02.350 --> 10:03.600
<b>That means…</b>

10:04.850 --> 10:08.400
<b>None of us can even do subtractions, so…</b>

10:09.060 --> 10:11.360
<b>We'll have to walk the bumpy road.</b>

10:11.440 --> 10:13.900
<b>Dali, is this the only way?</b>

10:13.980 --> 10:17.030
<b>Can't we just go find him between classes?</b>

10:17.990 --> 10:19.070
<b>You're right.</b>

10:19.160 --> 10:20.620
<b>Maybe we can.</b>

10:21.490 --> 10:22.530
<b>Whoa.</b>

10:22.620 --> 10:25.870
<b>That was really a great speech, Eiji.</b>

10:25.950 --> 10:27.160
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:27.250 --> 10:30.580
<b>I'm honored to be
in the same class as you.</b>

10:31.000 --> 10:31.880
<b>Eiji.</b>

10:32.750 --> 10:34.380
<b>Your speech</b>

10:34.460 --> 10:36.590
<b>was really touching!</b>

10:36.670 --> 10:38.680
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

10:38.760 --> 10:40.550
<b>I'm Eiji's friend.</b>

10:40.640 --> 10:43.310
<b>Isn't that right, Eiji?</b>

10:43.680 --> 10:45.930
<b>We met at the party and the Boy Scouts.</b>

10:52.230 --> 10:54.360
<b>I have no idea who you are.</b>

10:59.490 --> 11:00.820
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

11:00.910 --> 11:02.780
<b><i>He doesn't mingle with morons.</i></b>

11:03.450 --> 11:04.700
<b>Here we go.</b>

11:04.790 --> 11:06.620
<b>Say cheese.</b>

11:06.950 --> 11:07.750
<b><i>In that case…</i></b>

11:08.460 --> 11:09.410
<b>Hitori!</b>

11:09.500 --> 11:11.120
<b><i>We have no other choice.</i></b>

11:11.460 --> 11:13.290
<b><i>We must excel at our exams.</i></b>

11:17.090 --> 11:19.260
<b>Where did you go?</b>

11:19.340 --> 11:20.590
<b>Here we go!</b>

11:20.680 --> 11:22.430
<b>Say cheese.</b>

11:25.140 --> 11:26.390
<b>Hitori?</b>

11:26.470 --> 11:29.520
<b><i>We will wiggle</i>
<i>right into Eiji Ichijo's pocket.</i></b>

11:36.280 --> 11:37.650
<b><i>The two of us</i></b>

11:37.730 --> 11:39.490
<b><i>as one gifted child.</i></b>

11:44.120 --> 11:45.370
<b>One, two…</b>

11:51.460 --> 11:52.620
<b>Migi.</b>

11:52.710 --> 11:55.090
<b>This is awful even for a quick quiz.</b>

11:55.170 --> 11:57.710
<b>We split the subjects between us,</b>

11:57.840 --> 12:01.300
<b>but midterms are getting close.</b>

12:01.760 --> 12:02.590
<b>Which is why</b>

12:02.680 --> 12:06.050
<b>I found the perfect place
where even you can focus.</b>

12:06.970 --> 12:08.020
<b>It's…</b>

12:09.390 --> 12:11.480
<b>Migi. Are you listening to me?</b>

12:12.230 --> 12:14.980
<b>I saw a goddess today.</b>

12:15.940 --> 12:17.110
<b>Whoaa.</b>

12:17.190 --> 12:18.440
<b>Look over here.</b>

12:19.740 --> 12:20.690
<b>What's going on?</b>

12:21.400 --> 12:22.610
<b>What class is she in?</b>

12:22.700 --> 12:23.860
<b>A transfer student?</b>

12:35.710 --> 12:38.340
<b>Migi. We have no time for tomfoolery.</b>

12:39.050 --> 12:41.720
<b>We have to become gifted children.</b>

12:42.220 --> 12:43.680
<b>To get our revenge.</b>

12:43.760 --> 12:46.600
<b>-Her silky black hair…
-Hey.</b>

12:46.680 --> 12:49.180
<b>-Eyes just like mother's…
-Listen to me!</b>

12:51.060 --> 12:53.390
<b>She's the Virgin Mary of the Library…</b>

12:54.270 --> 12:55.850
<b>Stupid Migi! That girl is…</b>

12:55.940 --> 12:59.860
<b>I would do anything for her.</b>

13:03.740 --> 13:04.950
<b>Listen, Migi.</b>

13:07.200 --> 13:09.120
<b>Make that girl notice you.</b>

13:09.700 --> 13:11.580
<b>Absolutely I will.</b>

13:25.260 --> 13:26.220
<b>Uhm…</b>

13:26.590 --> 13:27.510
<b>Well…</b>

13:28.300 --> 13:30.310
<b>I'm Anoyama Hitori.</b>

13:31.470 --> 13:32.770
<b>What's your name?</b>

13:35.480 --> 13:37.350
<b>J.D SALINGER - NINE STORIES</b>

13:39.110 --> 13:40.110
<b>Sali.</b>

13:40.440 --> 13:41.940
<b>My name is Sali.</b>

13:44.240 --> 13:46.740
<b>Nice to meet you, Sali.</b>

13:46.820 --> 13:49.700
<b>I have no interest in stupid people.</b>

13:51.290 --> 13:54.120
<b>Come back when you're smart.</b>

14:06.470 --> 14:08.390
<b><i>Hitori Anoyama, huh?</i></b>

14:10.350 --> 14:12.430
<b><i>While Migi was in class,</i></b>

14:12.510 --> 14:16.730
<b><i>I found a place</i>
<i>where I could properly concentrate.</i></b>

14:17.480 --> 14:20.480
<b>Sonoyama, shouldn't you
be in gym class right now?</b>

14:20.860 --> 14:22.190
<b><i>I was chased out,</i></b>

14:22.820 --> 14:24.610
<b><i>so I had to disguise myself.</i></b>

14:26.820 --> 14:29.110
<b><i>Though I never expected Migi to fancy me.</i></b>

14:32.660 --> 14:35.330
<b><i>This is useful.</i></b>

14:37.080 --> 14:39.120
<b>S-Sali.</b>

14:40.750 --> 14:42.960
<b>This is proof that I'm smart.</b>

14:45.510 --> 14:47.090
<b><i>Would you look at that.</i></b>

14:49.220 --> 14:51.600
<b><i>Wait. These are my exam papers!</i></b>

14:53.510 --> 14:56.310
<b><i>I forgot that</i>
<i>Migi would do something like this.</i></b>

14:58.980 --> 15:00.400
<b>Hitori.</b>

15:00.480 --> 15:02.230
<b>Let's study together later.</b>

15:02.730 --> 15:04.190
<b>Huh? Really?</b>

15:05.110 --> 15:06.320
<b>I mean,</b>

15:06.570 --> 15:10.450
<b>you're a smart boy, right?</b>

15:40.270 --> 15:41.140
<b><i>Migi.</i></b>

15:41.230 --> 15:42.810
<b><i>I'll keep watch on you.</i></b>

15:45.230 --> 15:47.530
<b>Midterms are only a week away now.</b>

15:48.400 --> 15:50.490
<b><i>The results on his tests</i></b>

15:50.570 --> 15:51.950
<b><i>are skyrocketing.</i></b>

15:52.570 --> 15:53.990
<b><i>If he keeps this up…</i></b>

15:55.280 --> 15:57.120
<b>So how do you feel,</b>

15:57.240 --> 15:58.410
<b>Hitori?</b>

15:59.620 --> 16:00.910
<b>I…</b>

16:01.540 --> 16:04.080
<b>I love you, Sali!</b>

16:05.590 --> 16:07.590
<b><i>That's not what I asked!</i></b>

16:08.090 --> 16:10.300
<b>I mean, you…</b>

16:10.380 --> 16:12.550
<b>you often look me in the eyes, and…</b>

16:13.140 --> 16:15.550
<b>Do you like me?</b>

16:17.220 --> 16:18.180
<b><i>Like.</i></b>

16:19.770 --> 16:20.890
<b><i>Or not.</i></b>

16:22.310 --> 16:25.520
<b><i>Neither of those answers</i>
<i>will make him study harder.</i></b>

16:26.270 --> 16:27.400
<b><i>Unless…</i></b>

16:27.980 --> 16:30.320
<b>I could fall in love with you.</b>

16:31.610 --> 16:34.620
<b>But only if you get
a 100 in English and Japanese.</b>

16:39.750 --> 16:41.040
<b>Today is the day.</b>

16:41.910 --> 16:43.750
<b>Don't lower your guard, Migi.</b>

16:44.290 --> 16:46.710
<b>I know, Dali.</b>

16:48.000 --> 16:49.130
<b>Let's do it.</b>

17:09.320 --> 17:10.610
<b><i>Not bad at all.</i></b>

17:11.780 --> 17:14.200
<b><i>All we need now is Migi's scores.</i></b>

17:14.320 --> 17:17.370
<b><i>Guess I'll praise him</i>
<i>if they're anything above 70.</i></b>

17:21.250 --> 17:22.330
<b>Hitori.</b>

17:22.830 --> 17:24.370
<b>How did the test go?</b>

17:31.590 --> 17:32.710
<b>Sali.</b>

17:33.380 --> 17:36.220
<b>I'm a smart kid now.</b>

17:37.010 --> 17:38.300
<b>Maybe now…</b>

17:38.390 --> 17:40.220
<b>You've fallen for me…</b>

17:41.470 --> 17:44.140
<b>Even just a little bit?</b>

17:55.200 --> 17:57.280
<b>W… Wri…</b>

17:57.360 --> 17:58.240
<b>Write…</b>

18:02.370 --> 18:03.950
<b><i>Guess there's no helping it.</i></b>

18:05.370 --> 18:07.040
<b>How about</b>

18:07.500 --> 18:09.040
<b>a date this Sunday?</b>

19:10.060 --> 19:12.230
<b>I thought it would look pretty on you.</b>

19:17.440 --> 19:18.320
<b><i>No.</i></b>

19:18.780 --> 19:21.450
<b><i>I can't keep fooling Migi like this.</i></b>

19:24.280 --> 19:25.580
<b>Hitori.</b>

19:27.580 --> 19:28.710
<b>I…</b>

19:29.620 --> 19:32.290
<b>I'm moving to a place far away from here.</b>

19:32.840 --> 19:33.630
<b>What?</b>

